    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Other Hermes apps",
      "items": [
        "Conduit talks to the Hermes dashboard. The dashboard runs Conduit's turn itself and saves it, or hands it to the gateway queue when that chat is busy.",
        "Hermes Desktop on the Hermes machine talks to the gateway directly. The gateway saves every turn it runs.",
        "CLI and TUI chats land in saved chats. How they get there isn't in the docs; confirm in source."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Open item",
      "items": [
        "bb mirrors all of these from saved chats. How v1 reads them is to be decided in the plan rewrite."
      ]
    }
